        "answer": {
          "short": "$r=-\\frac15$, $S_\\infty=-\\frac53$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}r&=\\frac{2/5}{-2}\\\\r&=-\\frac15\\\\|r|&=\\frac15<1\\\\S_\\infty&=\\frac{-2}{1-(-1/5)}\\\\S_\\infty&=-\\frac53\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
